<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE Jan wheat down A$3/tonne on profit taking.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE Jan wheat down A$3/tonne on profit taking.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nearby wheat futures traded lower in light volumes on the Sydney Futures Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>January led the retreat, falling A$3.00 to A$163.50 a tonne on volume of 45 lots. March fell A$1.00 to A$162.50 a tonne on volume of 5 lots. No other contracts were traded.</p>
<p>Traders said January wheat provided a good opportunity for profit taking after gaining A$4.00 a tonne on Friday.</p>
